NOTICE — scope of this license

The MIT license above covers the LeapSinger **source code** only. It does NOT
cover the following, which have their own separate terms:

  - The bundled neural vocoder ONNX files (`checkpoints/nhv_v3.onnx`,
    `checkpoints/nhv_v3x.onnx`). These come from the NHVSing project
    (https://github.com/wavtechyukky/NHVSing/) and are governed by its license.

  - The trained acoustic-model checkpoints distributed via GitHub Releases, and
    the singing-voice databases used to train them (Oniku Kurumi, Natsume Yuuri,
    Namine Ritsu). These are governed by each database's own terms of use — see
    `CREDITS.txt` bundled with the model release. In particular, credit and,
    for some databases, the bundled terms of use must be kept when redistributing.
